1
00:00:01,208 --> 00:00:02,375
Summary

2
00:00:05,541 --> 00:00:06,625
In this video,

3
00:00:06,625 --> 00:00:09,416
we discussed what radiation therapy is,

4
00:00:09,416 --> 00:00:12,250
the purpose of radiation in cancer treatment, 

5
00:00:12,250 --> 00:00:15,583
and what to expect
on your radiation treatment journey.

6
00:00:15,875 --> 00:00:18,291
While this is only a bird's eye overview

7
00:00:18,291 --> 00:00:21,333
and your personal experience may 
differ in detail,

8
00:00:21,333 --> 00:00:26,083
we hope this video will start
to demystify this treatment technique.

9
00:00:26,083 --> 00:00:28,833
We expect you to continue
to have questions,

10
00:00:28,833 --> 00:00:32,458
and we are more than happy
to answer them at any point.

11
00:00:32,666 --> 00:00:38,208
Please know that your cancer team is here
to support you every step of the way.
